          "text": "Témoignages: CARQUEIRANNE (83) 17.02.2012",
          "text_sha256": "f1d9e9cef0dfdd71863521ecc5649e40faf971b497eda1d37869959a9991756b"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
